{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016350/extras/e03f43747dfaad39d64f3af7974e7a6e.avif?t=1762380141\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016350/extras/97d6466e37d128e86b19b22645518778.avif?t=1762380141\" width=1200 height=120 /></span><strong>Smash Puck</strong> is what happens when you mix <strong>Pool, Pinball, and Curling</strong> then <strong>throw in magnets, portals, moving platforms, force fields,</strong> and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016350/extras/84b271a2e1543fce853a3db787f85931.poster.avif?t=1762380141\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016350/extras/84b271a2e1543fce853a3db787f85931.webm?t=1762380141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit a puck to sink balls into holes. You\u2019ve got a limited number of shots, and each stage gets tougher as new mechanics are introduced.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016350/extras/0d821ab960c22852f25c647b0a20870e.poster.avif?t=1762380141\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016350/extras/0d821ab960c22852f25c647b0a20870e.webm?t=1762380141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120 handcrafted levels across 10 unique worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack with 6 tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So colourful!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016350/extras/272019609c7ae2faf328acaef519cf41.poster.avif?t=1762380141\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016350/extras/272019609c7ae2faf328acaef519cf41.webm?t=1762380141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on Windows or Mac</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud save support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully localized in 11 languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Very yummy!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016350/extras/f80720323759a5ab3767134070be7106.poster.avif?t=1762380141\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016350/extras/f80720323759a5ab3767134070be7106.webm?t=1762380141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We set out to unify the best of classic ball games into one playful, challenging experience. We hope you enjoy it!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016350?t=1762380141","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016350/85ed5430352a20c116e9ef4ef367c